# Shylenai's owls in Darnassus.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, two owls; the new Eagle Owl); Forever client
# 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse prices; every pet item teaches its
# companion when used).

step Shylenai
  tip Shylenai sells three owls in Darnassus (50s each); the Eagle Owl is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8665                         -- Shylenai
  buy 8500 npc 8665 optional          -- Great Horned Owl, 50s
  buy 8501 npc 8665 optional          -- Hawk Owl, 50s
  buy 280803 "Eagle Owl" npc 8665 optional -- 50s
